In crate: fixture-crate (0.1.0)

A generic enum for testing

See also [crate::TestEnum](https://docs.rs/fixture-crate/0.1.0/fixture_crate/submodule/enum.TestEnum.html)

enum GenericEnum<T, U = [String](https://doc.rust-lang.org/nightly/alloc/string/struct.String.html)>
where
    T: [Clone](https://doc.rust-lang.org/nightly/core/clone/trait.Clone.html) + [Send](https://doc.rust-lang.org/nightly/core/marker/trait.Send.html),
    U: [std::fmt::Display](https://doc.rust-lang.org/nightly/core/fmt/trait.Display.html),
{
    Simple,
    WithData(T),
    Mixed {
        data: T,
        info: U,
    },
}

Variants:

  ◦ Simple 
    Simple variant

  ◦ WithData 
    Variant with generic data

  ◦ Mixed 
    Variant with mixed generics

